# arm64 guest paravirt: PARAVIRT (shared file) already carries steal-time;
# the arch timer and PSCI need no guest-side symbols, and there is no PVH --
# FC/CH on arm64 boot the uncompressed Image directly.

# The base 40-platform.arm64 asks for the SMMU and CPPC cpufreq; a guest has
# neither -- DMA protection is virtio-iommu, frequency is the host's problem.
# CONFIG_ARM_SMMU_V3 is not set
# CONFIG_ACPI_CPPC_CPUFREQ is not set
